error[type-mismatch] 6:25-6:43
    (sort-by (fn [r] (str (- (get r :count)) "|" (get r :tag))) tag-counts))
                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  A sort key built with str joins strings only, but this argument is an Int.
  Expected: String
  Found: Int
  To sort by several keys, return a tuple: (fn [r] [(- (get r :count)) (get r :tag)])
  Help: sx help sort-by
